<Row crossAxisAlignment="START"><Container width="34" height="34" color="#E0E7FF" borderRadius="17" alignment="CENTER"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="16" color="#3730A3" fontStyle="BOLD">01</Text></Container><SizedBox width="12"/><Expanded><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#334155">本单为虚构排版测试，不是实际发票。</Text></Expanded></Row>
