<Row crossAxisAlignment="START"><Container width="34" height="34" color="#E0E7FF" borderRadius="17" alignment="CENTER"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="16" color="#3730A3" fontStyle="BOLD">03</Text></Container><SizedBox width="12"/><Expanded><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#334155">税额以税前折后货品金额乘6%，四舍五入至分；最终应付再加运费。</Text></Expanded></Row>
<SizedBox height="10"/>
